 R←Test_Misc_015(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;folder;s;tie;level
⍝ Rumba's `OpenLogFile` must create log.txt for every value of [LOGGING]LogHTTP that Plodder accepts.
⍝ Up to RumbaLean 3.5.2 it failed with a DOMAIN ERROR on `LogHTTP = 2`, so the server could not start.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 folder←∆GetTestFolder,'/Test_Misc_015'
 :For level :In 1 2
     {}##.FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce folder
     s←⎕NS''
     s.(LogHTTP LogRumba LogConga)←level 0 0
     s.Folder←folder
     tie←Rumba.OpenLogFile s
     →T.PassesIf 0>tie
     ⎕NUNTIE tie
     →T.PassesIf ⎕NEXISTS folder,'/log.txt'
 :EndFor

 s.(LogHTTP LogRumba LogConga)←0 0 0
 →T.PassesIf 0=Rumba.OpenLogFile s                  ⍝ No log.txt when nothing is logged

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
